Implementation Consortium (CPIC) and by PharmGKB / ClinPGx, both of which make
their content available under CC BY-SA 4.0. A derived dataset therefore has to
carry the same license. The upstream license files that ship with the raw
downloads are copied verbatim into data/sources/ at build time.

